Arguments for kg_create_edge:

source_id (required): UUID of the source node
target_id (required): UUID of the target node
relationship_type (required): Type of relationship (e.g., 'attended', 'works_for', 'located_at')
attributes (optional): Additional key-value pairs for the relationship
sentence (optional): Natural language description of the relationship
confidence (optional): Confidence score 0.0-1.0
importance (optional): Importance score 0.0-1.0

Example:
{
    "source_id": "abc-123-def-456",
    "target_id": "xyz-789-uvw-012",
    "relationship_type": "attended",
    "sentence": "Alex attended the wedding"
}
